OL,3,AFears of second Nepal-Tibet flood put
OL,4,Arescuers 'on edge' as search for
OL,5,Asurvivors continues
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe search for survivors is continuing
OL,8,Ffor a second night in Nepal and Tibet
OL,9,Fwhere flash flooding on Wednesday
OL,10,Fdevastated the Himalayan border region
OL,12,FIn Nepal, over 900 people are missing
OL,13,Fand at least 389 have died. In Tibet,
OL,14,Fthree people have died and more than
OL,15,F550 are missing. It's not clear if the
OL,16,Flatest figures overlap
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
