OL,3,AFears of second Nepal-Tibet flood put
OL,4,Arescuers 'on edge' as search for
OL,5,Asurvivors continues
OL,6,
OL,7,FA collapsed glacier on Nepal's side of
OL,8,Fthe border caused the huge flood wave,
OL,9,Fofficials there tell the BBC. The surge
OL,10,Ftore through houses and roads, and
OL,11,Fdestroyed a key Nepal-Tibet border
OL,12,Fcrossing
OL,14,FTens of thousands of tourists visit the
OL,15,Fflood-hit area every year. A man from
OL,16,FEast London tells the BBC his missing
OL,17,Fsister was "really excited" to go on
OL,18,Fher first pilgrimage there
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
